<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Kong to sell HK$25 bln flats 1997.</title>
<headline>Cheung Kong to sell HK$25 bln flats 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property developer Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd is set to launch sales of at least five residential projects this year with a total market value of HK$25 billion, the Hong Kong Standard newspaper said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The paper was quoting Cheung Kong's sales manager William Kwok.</p>
<p>Cheung Kong officials were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
